=============================================================
  IDENTIFICATION - prewhitening and CCF (Box-Jenkins)         
  Input 1: SYN2_X1
=============================================================
  The input is prewhitened with its own ARMA and the SAME filter
  is applied to the output.  r(k) = corr(beta_t, a_{t-k}):
    k > 0  ->  Y responds to X with a k-period lag (the transfer)
    k < 0  ->  Y leads X (feedback: there should be NONE)

